<title>USA: Universal Outdoor files for note offering.</title>
<headline>Universal Outdoor files for note offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Outdoor Holdings Inc. filed on Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of $200 million of senior subordinated notes due 2006.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to repay bank debt, repurchase certain outstanding notes and finance a protion of the purchase price in connection with certain acquisitions, it said.</p>
<p>Underwriters are Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc. and BT Securities Corp., the company said.</p>
</text>
